Package: dell-rf
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, udev
Description: pair and unpair Dell wireless mice and keyboards
 Manage paired devices on a validated Dell Universal USB receiver from Linux.
 Pairing and removal require confirmation and verify the resulting slot state.
